### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Compare reported average REST duration with operation mix and collection load. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Expensive filters, indexing contention, storage latency or resource pressure.

### Fix
Tune the observed expensive queries and indexes; resolve CPU, memory or storage contention.

### Verify
Average REST duration drops below the threshold during comparable traffic. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
